1
00:00:06,860 --> 00:00:12,060
=Fatal Proximity to Him=

2
00:00:12,060 --> 00:00:14,100
=Episode 8=

3
00:00:34,820 --> 00:00:36,220
Jiang Yuan injured her back this time.

4
00:00:36,740 --> 00:00:38,420
Do you think she'll have to retire?

5
00:00:38,700 --> 00:00:39,620
What a shame.

6
00:00:39,900 --> 00:00:41,820
She's only been principal
for three years.

7
00:00:42,220 --> 00:00:43,580
I wonder who

8
00:00:43,940 --> 00:00:44,580
in our company

9
00:00:44,580 --> 00:00:45,300
will replace her.

10
00:00:45,660 --> 00:00:47,260
(It definitely won't be me.)

11
00:00:47,620 --> 00:00:48,780
(It'll either be Luo Xiyu)

12
00:00:48,900 --> 00:00:49,940
(or Song Shuqi.)

13
00:00:50,500 --> 00:00:51,780
After tomorrow's ribbon-cutting,

14
00:00:52,060 --> 00:00:53,540
we go straight into our performance.

15
00:00:53,940 --> 00:00:54,820
Who's dancing Mary

16
00:00:54,860 --> 00:00:55,780
in this one?

17
00:00:56,140 --> 00:00:57,500
I heard it's Xiyu.

18
00:00:58,060 --> 00:00:59,740
See? I told you Xiyu was amazing.

19
00:00:59,940 --> 00:01:02,460
Her boyfriend's a well-known doctor
at the hospital,

20
00:01:02,780 --> 00:01:04,580
and now she's principal too.

21
00:01:04,740 --> 00:01:06,780
She really gets all the good things.

22
00:01:21,140 --> 00:01:23,060
Your very own latte art.

23
00:01:24,580 --> 00:01:25,900
Guess who I ran into yesterday.

24
00:01:26,340 --> 00:01:27,060
Who?

25
00:01:31,460 --> 00:01:32,140
Yesterday,

26
00:01:32,460 --> 00:01:34,660
two people from Yunshan Group
came in for coffee.

27
00:01:35,140 --> 00:01:37,260
I overheard them gossiping
about the company.

28
00:01:37,660 --> 00:01:39,820
They said He Lan is
the second in command there now.

29
00:01:40,100 --> 00:01:41,980
My ears perked right up.

30
00:01:41,980 --> 00:01:43,380
I thought, "No way. What are the odds?"

31
00:01:43,940 --> 00:01:45,340
So I secretly followed them out.

32
00:01:46,420 --> 00:01:47,220
That's him, right?

33
00:01:48,900 --> 00:01:49,580
That's him.

34
00:01:50,700 --> 00:01:51,740
I can't believe it.

35
00:01:51,900 --> 00:01:52,940
After going to prison,

36
00:01:52,940 --> 00:01:54,140
he's still doing this well.

37
00:01:54,300 --> 00:01:55,020
I...

38
00:01:55,020 --> 00:01:55,900
I didn't mean it like that.

39
00:01:56,500 --> 00:01:57,220
I mean,

40
00:01:57,460 --> 00:01:58,500
back then,

41
00:01:58,500 --> 00:01:59,420
he got out early,

42
00:01:59,460 --> 00:01:59,900
but

43
00:01:59,900 --> 00:02:00,860
didn't even tell you.

44
00:02:01,100 --> 00:02:03,260
You went to pick him up,
and he was already gone.

45
00:02:03,420 --> 00:02:04,540
It's been ten years,

46
00:02:04,580 --> 00:02:05,980
and you haven't heard a word from him.

47
00:02:06,340 --> 00:02:07,940
If his life had gone badly,
that'd be one thing.

48
00:02:08,220 --> 00:02:09,980
But if he's doing this well,
why hasn't he looked for you?

49
00:02:10,660 --> 00:02:12,060
As long as he's doing well,
that's enough.

50
00:02:13,100 --> 00:02:13,780
Because of me,

51
00:02:14,260 --> 00:02:15,540
he's already suffered enough.

52
00:02:16,860 --> 00:02:18,020
Besides, you said it yourself.

53
00:02:18,940 --> 00:02:19,820
It's been ten years.

54
00:02:21,140 --> 00:02:22,980
Maybe whatever he felt for me
is long gone.

55
00:02:23,580 --> 00:02:23,980
Then...

56
00:02:24,100 --> 00:02:24,940
what about you?

57
00:02:25,780 --> 00:02:27,340
Your mom likes Zhang Jinghang so much.

58
00:02:27,700 --> 00:02:28,540
And Zhang Jinghang

59
00:02:28,540 --> 00:02:30,860
is now the youngest attending physician
in the city.

60
00:02:31,140 --> 00:02:32,980
His mentor is one of the province's
top surgeons.

61
00:02:33,300 --> 00:02:34,140
Anyone with eyes

62
00:02:34,140 --> 00:02:35,580
can tell he's into you.

63
00:02:37,020 --> 00:02:37,860
So what do you think?

64
00:02:38,620 --> 00:02:40,740
Right now, I'm focused on
becoming principal.

65
00:02:41,740 --> 00:02:42,700
I don't have time for dating.

66
00:02:43,860 --> 00:02:46,060
Well, that doesn't sound
very convincing.

67
00:02:46,940 --> 00:02:48,260
(I can't even fool Xiaoba.)

68
00:02:49,300 --> 00:02:51,020
(How could I ever fool myself?)

69
00:02:58,180 --> 00:02:59,700
I have an announcement.

70
00:03:00,140 --> 00:03:01,900
Senior executives from Yunshan Group

71
00:03:01,900 --> 00:03:03,260
are coming to see our show tonight.

72
00:03:03,540 --> 00:03:04,740
They'll be seated in the VIP section.

73
00:03:05,100 --> 00:03:05,900
So everyone needs to

74
00:03:05,900 --> 00:03:07,180
be at the top of their game.

75
00:03:08,740 --> 00:03:09,380
Especially you,

76
00:03:09,380 --> 00:03:10,020
Luo Xiyu.

77
00:03:10,140 --> 00:03:11,220
It's your first time dancing the lead.

78
00:03:11,500 --> 00:03:12,340
Don't mess it up.

79
00:03:12,820 --> 00:03:13,220
Okay.

80
00:03:13,780 --> 00:03:14,180
Alright.

81
00:03:14,220 --> 00:03:14,740
Good luck.

82
00:03:27,260 --> 00:03:28,780
(Will he be sitting out there too?)

83
00:03:41,340 --> 00:03:42,580
If you're getting stage fright,

84
00:03:42,820 --> 00:03:44,300
there's still time to back out.

85
00:03:44,620 --> 00:03:46,700
I've already mastered
the principal's part.

86
00:03:46,860 --> 00:03:48,500
Handing an opportunity to someone else

87
00:03:49,100 --> 00:03:50,340
isn't my style.

88
00:03:57,220 --> 00:03:58,820
(Last time, I danced Swan Lake.)

89
00:03:59,460 --> 00:04:00,380
(This time, I didn't.)

90
00:04:01,020 --> 00:04:02,420
(Maybe if one thing has changed,)

91
00:04:02,500 --> 00:04:03,620
(other things can change too.)

92
00:04:17,740 --> 00:04:19,660
(He's been out for five years
and never came to see me.)

93
00:04:20,100 --> 00:04:20,820
(Luo Xiyu,)

94
00:04:21,100 --> 00:04:22,140
(what are you hoping for?)

95
00:04:43,580 --> 00:04:44,060
(Director,)

96
00:04:44,220 --> 00:04:47,060
(what's the name of the girl
dancing the lead tonight?)

97
00:04:53,940 --> 00:04:55,020
(Director: Luo Xiyu.)
(Dinner's on me tonight.)

98
00:04:55,020 --> 00:04:57,140
(Bring the lead dancers along.)

99
00:05:06,340 --> 00:05:06,900
Mr. Chen,

100
00:05:07,380 --> 00:05:08,980
thank you for the group's
strong support.

101
00:05:09,020 --> 00:05:09,580
We're also looking forward

102
00:05:09,580 --> 00:05:10,220
to working together

103
00:05:10,220 --> 00:05:10,980
over the next three years.

104
00:05:12,180 --> 00:05:12,740
However,

105
00:05:12,740 --> 00:05:14,580
tonight's attendance

106
00:05:14,660 --> 00:05:16,220
wasn't even eighty percent.

107
00:05:21,780 --> 00:05:23,020
That is an issue.

108
00:05:23,180 --> 00:05:25,020
But that's because our former
principal was...

109
00:05:26,380 --> 00:05:27,460
Every cloud has a silver lining.

110
00:05:27,500 --> 00:05:28,660
This could turn out to be a good thing.

111
00:05:29,140 --> 00:05:30,180
These days,

112
00:05:30,180 --> 00:05:31,300
audience draw is everything.

113
00:05:32,020 --> 00:05:34,100
Even the best product
needs good publicity.

114
00:05:35,220 --> 00:05:36,420
Yunshan Group

115
00:05:36,420 --> 00:05:37,940
is looking to sign a ballet company

116
00:05:37,940 --> 00:05:38,980
for a long-term partnership.

117
00:05:39,820 --> 00:05:41,700
I think your company
would be a perfect fit.

118
00:05:45,100 --> 00:05:45,740
Director.

119
00:05:48,100 --> 00:05:48,980
Take a look.

120
00:05:50,460 --> 00:05:52,180
(II. Content and Methods of Cooperation
Scope of Cooperation; Work Arrangements)

121
00:05:57,900 --> 00:06:00,140
(Payment: 12 Million Yuan)

122
00:06:02,820 --> 00:06:04,780
There's always a new generation
of talent.

123
00:06:04,860 --> 00:06:05,300
Look,

124
00:06:05,300 --> 00:06:06,340
these dancers

125
00:06:06,340 --> 00:06:07,740
leading the company now

126
00:06:07,940 --> 00:06:09,420
are all extremely talented.

127
00:06:09,740 --> 00:06:10,740
Our group

128
00:06:10,860 --> 00:06:12,380
also holds quite a few corporate events.

129
00:06:13,420 --> 00:06:14,340
Ballet...

130
00:06:14,380 --> 00:06:15,860
(Zhang Jinghang: Show over? Dinner?)
(I'm at Wuqige for a group dinner now.)

131
00:06:15,860 --> 00:06:16,700
(I'll slip out when I get the chance.)

132
00:06:16,700 --> 00:06:17,980
It could also help

133
00:06:18,460 --> 00:06:19,260
strengthen our company's

134
00:06:19,580 --> 00:06:20,580
(Zhang Jinghang: I'll pick you up; OK.)
brand building

135
00:06:21,060 --> 00:06:22,140
and public image.

136
00:06:22,260 --> 00:06:23,060
Absolutely.

137
00:06:23,100 --> 00:06:24,420
Our dancers

138
00:06:24,540 --> 00:06:25,780
still have plenty of room to grow.

139
00:06:26,820 --> 00:06:27,220
Come on.

140
00:06:27,340 --> 00:06:28,220
A toast to Mr. Chen!

141
00:06:29,220 --> 00:06:29,780
Mr. Chen,

142
00:06:30,100 --> 00:06:31,580
we'll keep working hard.

143
00:06:33,890 --> 00:06:34,400
Well?

144
00:06:39,260 --> 00:06:40,860
From the look on your face, Ms. Luo,

145
00:06:41,380 --> 00:06:42,660
you seem to have some reservations.

146
00:06:46,900 --> 00:06:48,700
When it comes to ballet
and corporate events,

147
00:06:49,060 --> 00:06:51,260
I'd rather focus on perfecting my craft.

148
00:06:55,300 --> 00:06:56,980
Looks like my invitation

149
00:06:57,100 --> 00:06:58,580
isn't enough to persuade you, Ms. Luo.

150
00:06:58,980 --> 00:06:59,460
Well...

151
00:06:59,980 --> 00:07:00,860
Xiyu here

152
00:07:00,860 --> 00:07:02,220
is an exceptional dancer.

153
00:07:02,340 --> 00:07:03,380
We're grooming her

154
00:07:03,380 --> 00:07:04,540
to become our future principal.

155
00:07:06,660 --> 00:07:07,500
Exactly.

156
00:07:07,820 --> 00:07:09,380
Someone who's already danced the lead

157
00:07:09,660 --> 00:07:10,860
wouldn't be satisfied

158
00:07:10,900 --> 00:07:12,140
staying an understudy forever,
would she?

159
00:07:18,820 --> 00:07:19,540
Of course, of course.

160
00:07:19,660 --> 00:07:20,220
Xiyu,

161
00:07:20,740 --> 00:07:21,620
have a drink with Mr. Chen.

162
00:07:22,940 --> 00:07:23,460
Be nice.

163
00:07:26,020 --> 00:07:26,580
Go on.

164
00:07:36,940 --> 00:07:38,340
All this just to become principal?

165
00:07:39,740 --> 00:07:41,180
Drinking and smiling for favors?

166
00:08:09,740 --> 00:08:10,980
Didn't know you had it in you.

167
00:08:19,100 --> 00:08:21,140
(I imagined our reunion
a thousand different ways.)

168
00:08:21,900 --> 00:08:23,100
(But I never imagined)

169
00:08:23,740 --> 00:08:24,780
(he'd think I was)

170
00:08:24,780 --> 00:08:26,140
(a gold digger who drinks
and flirts her way to the top.)

171
00:08:26,140 --> 00:08:27,100
Alright now,

172
00:08:27,700 --> 00:08:28,980
I was only joking.

173
00:08:29,180 --> 00:08:30,420
Don't scare Ms. Luo.

174
00:08:30,940 --> 00:08:31,540
Let me

175
00:08:31,540 --> 00:08:32,580
formally introduce him.

176
00:08:32,900 --> 00:08:33,540
This is

177
00:08:33,540 --> 00:08:34,140
He Lan,

178
00:08:35,060 --> 00:08:36,900
the current CEO of Yunshan Group.

179
00:08:37,300 --> 00:08:38,300
If Yunshan

180
00:08:38,300 --> 00:08:39,540
signs Xinghai,

181
00:08:39,700 --> 00:08:40,540
there'll be plenty

182
00:08:40,540 --> 00:08:41,660
of day-to-day business

183
00:08:41,660 --> 00:08:42,420
that Mr. He

184
00:08:42,780 --> 00:08:44,180
will handle directly with you.

185
00:08:45,020 --> 00:08:45,780
Welcome, Mr. He.

186
00:08:45,820 --> 00:08:46,420
Welcome, Mr. He.

187
00:08:46,540 --> 00:08:47,460
Welcome.

188
00:08:47,620 --> 00:08:48,140
Welcome.

189
00:08:53,740 --> 00:08:54,300
Sorry.

190
00:08:54,340 --> 00:08:55,060
Excuse me.

191
00:08:55,300 --> 00:08:57,100
Ms. Luo's boyfriend is waiting outside.

192
00:08:59,300 --> 00:09:00,180
Sorry, everyone.

193
00:09:00,260 --> 00:09:01,180
I have something to take care of,

194
00:09:01,300 --> 00:09:02,180
so I'll excuse myself.

195
00:09:05,020 --> 00:09:05,860
Xiyu.

196
00:09:20,180 --> 00:09:21,660
(All this just to become principal?)

197
00:09:22,620 --> 00:09:24,140
(Drinking and smiling for favors?)

198
00:09:26,740 --> 00:09:28,020
(Didn't know you had it in you.)

199
00:09:28,660 --> 00:09:30,340
(Why do I care what he thinks?)

200
00:09:30,780 --> 00:09:32,180
(What is he to me now, anyway?)

201
00:09:32,700 --> 00:09:33,700
(He doesn't like me.)

202
00:09:33,700 --> 00:09:35,260
(Isn't that exactly
what I wanted in the first place?)

203
00:09:35,900 --> 00:09:36,500
(Besides...)

204
00:09:38,060 --> 00:09:39,420
(I still have this ring.)

205
00:09:39,940 --> 00:09:41,100
(My life won't be affected.)

206
00:09:42,180 --> 00:09:43,540
(I just can't let him see it.)

207
00:09:56,700 --> 00:09:58,780
(Luo Xiyu: BFA in Dance Performance;
Central Dance Academy)

208
00:10:00,540 --> 00:10:01,140
Mr. He,

209
00:10:01,220 --> 00:10:01,620
these are

210
00:10:01,620 --> 00:10:03,700
the contract revisions
from Xinghai Ballet Company.

211
00:10:04,900 --> 00:10:05,900
The director seems very eager.

212
00:10:05,900 --> 00:10:06,780
They barely changed anything.

213
00:10:09,020 --> 00:10:12,900
(Party A: Yunshan Group Co., Ltd.
Party B: Xinghai Ballet Company)

214
00:10:12,900 --> 00:10:14,140
Mr. Chen made them
a very generous offer.

215
00:10:14,820 --> 00:10:15,980
And Xinghai accepted pretty quickly.

216
00:10:16,260 --> 00:10:16,780
Yes.

217
00:10:17,580 --> 00:10:19,020
Mr. Chen seems

218
00:10:19,140 --> 00:10:19,900
very interested in

219
00:10:20,140 --> 00:10:21,060
Luo Xiyu.

220
00:10:30,900 --> 00:10:31,340
Alright.

221
00:10:32,180 --> 00:10:32,820
I got it.

222
00:10:33,180 --> 00:10:34,460
- This is my son's company!
- Ma'am, you can't go in!

223
00:10:34,460 --> 00:10:36,020
What do you mean I can't go in?

224
00:10:36,020 --> 00:10:37,260
- It's my son's company!
- Ma'am!

225
00:10:37,340 --> 00:10:38,900
We're his family. We come as we please!

226
00:10:39,620 --> 00:10:40,220
Mr. He.

227
00:10:40,580 --> 00:10:42,140
Sorry, I couldn't stop her.

228
00:10:45,100 --> 00:10:45,780
Lan,

229
00:10:46,100 --> 00:10:46,700
I spent hours

230
00:10:46,740 --> 00:10:48,420
making you this chicken soup.

231
00:10:48,460 --> 00:10:49,100
I used

232
00:10:49,140 --> 00:10:50,020
a free-range chicken.

233
00:10:50,020 --> 00:10:50,580
It smells amazing.

234
00:10:50,580 --> 00:10:50,900
Here.

235
00:10:50,900 --> 00:10:51,540
Try some.

236
00:10:51,900 --> 00:10:52,700
Yeah.

237
00:10:53,660 --> 00:10:55,140
We're family, aren't we?

238
00:10:55,500 --> 00:10:56,180
Look,

239
00:10:56,300 --> 00:10:57,580
you were both young back then.

240
00:10:57,700 --> 00:11:00,100
Even the best families
fight sometimes, right?

241
00:11:00,220 --> 00:11:01,580
It's been so many years.

242
00:11:01,660 --> 00:11:02,380
We're family.

243
00:11:02,580 --> 00:11:03,620
We should let bygones be bygones.

244
00:11:04,100 --> 00:11:04,780
Family?

245
00:11:07,500 --> 00:11:08,100
How about

246
00:11:08,140 --> 00:11:09,540
you do us a favor for your dad's sake?

247
00:11:09,700 --> 00:11:10,460
Junsheng

248
00:11:10,500 --> 00:11:11,820
has trouble getting around.

249
00:11:11,940 --> 00:11:12,500
Whenever he tries

250
00:11:12,500 --> 00:11:13,540
to find a job,

251
00:11:13,580 --> 00:11:14,620
he gets turned away everywhere.

252
00:11:14,820 --> 00:11:15,180
And look at you.

253
00:11:15,180 --> 00:11:16,340
You're doing so well now.

254
00:11:16,900 --> 00:11:17,940
Couldn't you find Junsheng

255
00:11:17,980 --> 00:11:18,940
some easy desk job?

256
00:11:18,980 --> 00:11:19,580
Exactly.

257
00:11:20,260 --> 00:11:21,420
Just something to make a living.

258
00:11:21,820 --> 00:11:23,380
Funny how back then, neither of you

259
00:11:23,380 --> 00:11:24,660
cared whether I had food to eat.

260
00:11:27,060 --> 00:11:27,780
Oh, come on.

261
00:11:27,780 --> 00:11:29,020
Look how successful you are now.

262
00:11:29,020 --> 00:11:30,620
You can afford anything you want.

263
00:11:30,740 --> 00:11:31,260
Just

264
00:11:31,380 --> 00:11:32,420
help your brother out.

265
00:11:32,700 --> 00:11:33,580
Come on, Lan.

266
00:11:34,540 --> 00:11:35,100
Fine.

267
00:11:36,380 --> 00:11:37,940
But my company doesn't
pay people to do nothing.

268
00:11:39,100 --> 00:11:39,660
He Lan,

269
00:11:40,020 --> 00:11:41,380
that's fine. The job can wait.

270
00:11:41,380 --> 00:11:42,140
There's no rush.

271
00:11:42,500 --> 00:11:42,980
But

272
00:11:43,180 --> 00:11:44,780
could you give us some money first?

273
00:11:45,020 --> 00:11:45,340
Look,

274
00:11:45,340 --> 00:11:46,660
our dad needs money for treatment.

275
00:11:46,860 --> 00:11:48,660
You spent all the relocation money?

276
00:11:49,140 --> 00:11:50,500
You've got it all wrong.

277
00:11:50,500 --> 00:11:51,340
Your dad's been sick

278
00:11:51,340 --> 00:11:52,740
all these years.

279
00:11:52,780 --> 00:11:53,820
That little bit of relocation money

280
00:11:53,860 --> 00:11:55,340
all went toward his medical bills.

281
00:11:55,540 --> 00:11:56,260
And Junsheng's leg rehabilitation

282
00:11:56,260 --> 00:11:57,420
cost us a fortune too.

283
00:11:58,060 --> 00:11:59,860
It's not like we pocketed any of it.

284
00:11:59,860 --> 00:12:00,420
Exactly.

285
00:12:01,380 --> 00:12:02,900
Over all these years, you came to me

286
00:12:02,900 --> 00:12:04,660
for every medical bill and surgery.

287
00:12:04,740 --> 00:12:05,260
And another thing.

288
00:12:06,100 --> 00:12:08,100
If you hadn't delayed
my dad's treatment,

289
00:12:08,700 --> 00:12:10,140
he wouldn't be paralyzed now.

290
00:12:11,860 --> 00:12:12,580
I'm asking you one thing.

291
00:12:12,860 --> 00:12:13,620
Are you giving us the money or not?

292
00:12:14,900 --> 00:12:15,380
Fine.

293
00:12:15,420 --> 00:12:16,260
So you're not giving it to us?

294
00:12:16,420 --> 00:12:17,540
You're the one turning
your back on family!

295
00:12:19,670 --> 00:12:20,220
Ugh!

296
00:12:20,220 --> 00:12:21,500
Oh dear!

297
00:12:21,500 --> 00:12:22,820
Everyone, come look!

298
00:12:22,820 --> 00:12:24,060
He Lan, don't get physical!

299
00:12:24,380 --> 00:12:25,700
I'm still your brother, bad leg and all!

300
00:12:25,700 --> 00:12:27,700
He's taking advantage of his status
to bully us!

301
00:12:29,220 --> 00:12:30,020
Li Xiaoxia!

302
00:12:31,900 --> 00:12:34,020
Did you forget where I just got out of?

303
00:12:39,460 --> 00:12:40,860
You need money
for my dad's treatment, right?

304
00:12:41,740 --> 00:12:42,300
Fine.

305
00:12:42,620 --> 00:12:43,580
I'll give you the money.

306
00:12:44,300 --> 00:12:46,700
I'll sell the house
you two are living in right now

307
00:12:47,260 --> 00:12:48,460
and use the money to treat my dad.

308
00:12:50,740 --> 00:12:51,180
Mom!

309
00:12:51,500 --> 00:12:53,380
Then you two can sleep on the street.

310
00:12:54,180 --> 00:12:54,780
Mr. He.

311
00:13:02,460 --> 00:13:03,060
Lan,

312
00:13:03,220 --> 00:13:03,980
I spent hours

313
00:13:04,060 --> 00:13:05,420
making this chicken soup.

314
00:13:05,420 --> 00:13:06,540
It's delicious. Have some.

315
00:13:06,540 --> 00:13:08,180
Save it for your son.

316
00:13:08,460 --> 00:13:09,340
He needs you more.

317
00:13:09,700 --> 00:13:10,620
Ungrateful brat!

318
00:13:11,260 --> 00:13:11,620
Let's go,

319
00:13:11,620 --> 00:13:12,060
Junsheng.

320
00:13:22,540 --> 00:13:23,100
Alright.

321
00:13:23,580 --> 00:13:24,380
Got it.

322
00:13:26,860 --> 00:13:27,420
Mr. He,

323
00:13:28,060 --> 00:13:29,660
Xinghai says everyone has agreed.

324
00:13:29,660 --> 00:13:31,380
But Luo Xiyu is the only one who said

325
00:13:31,660 --> 00:13:33,460
that if Xinghai signs with Yunshan,

326
00:13:33,460 --> 00:13:34,980
she'll leave Xinghai Ballet Company.

327
00:13:35,620 --> 00:13:36,380
The problem is...

328
00:13:37,220 --> 00:13:38,700
Mr. Chen is doing all this for her.

329
00:14:10,380 --> 00:14:15,260
♪I hide my racing heart without a sound♪

330
00:14:16,670 --> 00:14:21,470
♪I close my eyes and pretend
the story's been reset♪

331
00:14:22,800 --> 00:14:25,820
♪I steer clear of every path
that leads to you♪

332
00:14:25,820 --> 00:14:28,810
♪Trying to outrun the storm
we're destined for♪

333
00:14:29,330 --> 00:14:31,530
♪I thought if I didn't hear, see,
or speak of you♪

334
00:14:31,530 --> 00:14:34,980
♪I could cut every thread
that ties us together♪

335
00:14:36,210 --> 00:14:41,230
♪Through the endless night,
I guard my only secret♪

336
00:14:42,810 --> 00:14:47,830
♪In this new cycle, I watch you
become innocent again♪

337
00:14:48,990 --> 00:14:51,120
♪I tried to erase the fire we once had♪

338
00:14:51,120 --> 00:14:54,870
♪But I can't erase your name
carved into my bones♪

339
00:14:55,630 --> 00:14:57,810
♪The more I try to leave you behind♪

340
00:14:57,810 --> 00:15:02,070
♪The deeper I sink with no end in sight♪

341
00:15:02,070 --> 00:15:04,600
♪What if I stayed a little farther away♪

342
00:15:04,600 --> 00:15:08,270
♪Could I finally break free
from this cycle♪

343
00:15:08,740 --> 00:15:10,620
♪What if I took things a little slower♪

344
00:15:10,620 --> 00:15:14,850
♪Could I delay the moment
everything falls apart♪

345
00:15:14,850 --> 00:15:18,650
♪Maybe if I retreat to the edge
of my dreams♪

346
00:15:18,650 --> 00:15:21,660
♪I could give you another future♪

347
00:15:21,980 --> 00:15:28,210
♪A tomorrow where I no longer exist♪

348
00:15:28,210 --> 00:15:30,480
♪Even if I never want to see you again♪

349
00:15:30,480 --> 00:15:32,120
♪This nightmare still won't end♪

350
00:15:32,120 --> 00:15:33,980
♪Even if it all plays out again♪

351
00:15:33,980 --> 00:15:36,170
♪I'll still find my way back to you♪

352
00:15:36,170 --> 00:15:40,070
♪Even if having you only leaves me
in your debt♪

353
00:15:40,070 --> 00:15:44,060
♪It's still better than
losing you forever♪
